      "title": "You will use these words in",
      "frames": [
        "This is a …",
        "I have a …",
        "I am a …",
        "He is a …",
        "Where is the …?"
      ],
      "note": "hurt is the verb, pain is the noun: My head hurts. / I have a pain in my back. Czech says bolí mě hlava for both.",
      "note_cz": "hurt = sloveso (bolí), pain = podstatné jméno (bolest). Bolí mě hlava = My head hurts."
    }
